# Sri Subhakari Fashions — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Supabase credentials

# Supabase Configuration
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key

# How to get these values:
# 1. Go to https://supabase.com and create a project
# 2. In Project Settings > API, find your Project URL and anon/public key
# 3. Paste them above
# 4. Run the SQL migration from supabase/migrations/001_initial.sql in the Supabase SQL Editor
# 5. Create storage buckets: products, banners, gallery, testimonials
